# §D.8 row 7 — a `~MOD` on a SpatialFact kv other than *dir / *prox is
# accepted and then discarded; the modifier reaches no triple.
# §D.5: `kv = "*" IDENT value [ "~" MOD ]` — the modifier follows the value.
~scene
  /CameraView @cam *angle eye_level *framing medium_shot
  ^cam
  a /PhysicalObject Generic Inert Count *class Thing
  b /PhysicalObject Generic Inert Count *class Thing
  a ! EC b ^cam *viewer @cam ~partly
